# SYNTHETIC. Gmail caps daily transfer and simultaneous connections and answers excess with a
# lockout measured in hours. This must be Throttled and not a refusal: a refusal is fatal, and
# the store answers fatal by applying the undo patch and discarding the user's work.
S: * OK Gimap ready
C: a001 UID FETCH 1:* (UID)
S: a001 NO [LIMIT] Too many simultaneous connections
FAIL Throttled
